WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
SARS-CoV-2 Mutation Portal. A real visit to the URV research portal.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The homepage explains the dataset. Its displayed date is 26 February 2024; this is not a live-data claim.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Typing “spike” in the gene table returns two regions from 36 entries.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Using the native controls by keyboard, select spike, Spain and a percentage above 50. Submit a real, bounded query.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:56.000
The query returns four rows. Table search locates D614G without another server query.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The actual scatter plot shows mutation information on hover and supports selection zoom.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
A point-in-time walkthrough, not an exhaustive audit. Excel export returned HTTP 500 during inspection; no download is simulated.
